    privacyAdIdentifiers: "Advertising Identifiers: used only for advertising — on iOS, the Identifier for Advertisers (IDFA), only if you allow tracking; on Android, the advertising ID. Usage statistics are collected without advertising identifiers. Your advertising consent choice is stored on your device. To show and measure ads, AppLovin and the advertising networks it works with also receive your IP address, from which they may determine your approximate location (such as country or city), information about the ads you see and tap, and diagnostic data about their software on your device.",
    privacyPushToken: "Notification Token: if you allow notifications, a push-notification token of your device and your language are stored with your account, so that the Game can notify you about online games.",
